  texts:
  - Hello. I am calling to share important information regarding your latest test
    results.
  - Cognitive decline is still progressing with your age.
  - Pay close attention to your surroundings and focus whenever something looks out
    of place.
  - You are only supposed to take your medication whenever the clock chimes.
  - Thank you, Doctor....
